    Default (invariant / English) UI strings for Pipelines Explorer.
    Localized variants live in Strings.<culture>.resx (it, fr, de, es, sv).
    The brand "Pipelines Explorer" is intentionally NOT translated — see
    PipelinesExplorer.VisualStudio.Branding.ProductName.
  -->
  <xsd:schema id="root" xmlns="" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema" xmlns:msdata="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:xml-msdata">
